FOUNDATION
↓
DEFINITION
↓
DETAILED EXPLANATION
↓
FUNCTION / PURPOSE
↓
FORMS / STRUCTURE
↓
RULES
↓
SUB-RULES
↓
EXAMPLES
↓
CONTRASTING EXAMPLES
↓
EXCEPTIONS
↓
SPECIAL CASES
↓
COMMON ERRORS
↓
COMMON CONFUSIONS
